  "chapter": "第1话",
  "language_mode": "中文",
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "L001",
      "panel_id": "P001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "风里带着腥气。",
      "text_zh": "风里带着腥气。",
      "text_en": "The wind carried the smell of blood.",
      "slot_id": "B001N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L002",
      "panel_id": "P002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "姜月初还没能接受，自己穿越成了陌生女子。",
      "text_zh": "姜月初还没能接受，自己穿越成了陌生女子。",
      "text_en": "Jiang Yuechu still could not accept that she had crossed over into a stranger's body.",
      "slot_id": "B002N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L003",
      "panel_id": "P003",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "大唐。妖魔。罪臣之女。发配边疆。",
      "text_zh": "大唐。妖魔。罪臣之女。发配边疆。",
      "text_en": "Great Tang. Demons. A traitor's daughter. Exiled to the frontier.",
      "slot_id": "B003N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L004",
      "panel_id": "P004",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "是妖魔。还好……是死的。",
      "text_zh": "是妖魔。还好……是死的。",
      "text_en": "A demon. Good... it was dead.",
      "slot_id": "B004N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L005",
      "panel_id": "P005",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "裴长青",
      "text": "过来。",
      "text_zh": "过来。",
      "text_en": "Come here.",
      "tone": "沙哑命令",
      "slot_id": "B005D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L006",
      "panel_id": "P006",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她只想跑。没有户籍路引，也好过去边疆送死。",
      "text_zh": "她只想跑。没有户籍路引，也好过去边疆送死。",
      "text_en": "She only wanted to run. No household papers was still better than dying on the frontier.",
      "slot_id": "B006N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L007",
      "panel_id": "P007",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "咻",
      "text_zh": "咻",
      "text_en": "Whoosh",
      "slot_id": "B007S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L008",
      "panel_id": "P007",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "铮",
      "text_zh": "铮",
      "text_en": "Clang",
      "slot_id": "B007S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L009",
      "panel_id": "P008",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "裴长青",
      "text": "在下裴长青，陇右镇魔都司队正。",
      "text_zh": "在下裴长青，陇右镇魔都司队正。",
      "text_en": "I am Pei Changqing, squad captain of the Longyou Demon Suppression Office.",
      "tone": "强撑",
      "slot_id": "B008D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L010",
      "panel_id": "P008",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "裴长青",
      "text": "按我说的做，我保你脱籍。",
      "text_zh": "按我说的做，我保你脱籍。",
      "text_en": "Do as I say, and I will get you out of bondage.",
      "tone": "交易",
      "slot_id": "B008D2",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L011",
      "panel_id": "P009",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "姜月初",
      "text": "往……往哪儿走？",
      "text_zh": "往……往哪儿走？",
      "text_en": "W-where are we going?",
      "tone": "吃力",
      "slot_id": "B009D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L012",
      "panel_id": "P009",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "裴长青",
      "text": "往南。",
      "text_zh": "往南。",
      "text_en": "South.",
      "tone": "虚弱",
      "slot_id": "B009D2",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L013",
      "panel_id": "P010",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "虎妖",
      "text": "别跑了。",
      "text_zh": "别跑了。",
      "text_en": "Stop running.",
      "tone": "戏谑",
      "slot_id": "B010D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L014",
      "panel_id": "P010",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "咳",
      "text_zh": "咳",
      "text_en": "Cough",
      "slot_id": "B010S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L015",
      "panel_id": "P010",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "喀啦",
      "text_zh": "喀啦",
      "text_en": "Crack",
      "slot_id": "B010S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L016",
      "panel_id": "P011",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "都说人死不能复生。可没人告诉她，妖死也不行。",
      "text_zh": "都说人死不能复生。可没人告诉她，妖死也不行。",
      "text_en": "They said the dead could not rise. No one told her demons were the same.",
      "slot_id": "B011N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L017",
      "panel_id": "P011",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "砰",
      "text_zh": "砰",
      "text_en": "Thud",
      "slot_id": "B011S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L018",
      "panel_id": "P012",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "此妖，已半只脚踏入鸣骨之境。",
      "text_zh": "此妖，已半只脚踏入鸣骨之境。",
      "text_en": "This demon had already stepped halfway into the Bone-Ringing realm.",
      "slot_id": "B012N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L019",
      "panel_id": "P012",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "虎妖",
      "text": "真以为凭你们，便能杀我？",
      "text_zh": "真以为凭你们，便能杀我？",
      "text_en": "Did you truly think the likes of you could kill me?",
      "tone": "轻蔑",
      "slot_id": "B012D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L020",
      "panel_id": "P013",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "裴长青",
      "text": "死！",
      "text_zh": "死！",
      "text_en": "Die!",
      "tone": "暴喝",
      "slot_id": "B013D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L021",
      "panel_id": "P013",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "轰",
      "text_zh": "轰",
      "text_en": "Boom",
      "slot_id": "B013S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L022",
      "panel_id": "P013",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "砰",
      "text_zh": "砰",
      "text_en": "Thud",
      "slot_id": "B013S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L023",
      "panel_id": "P014",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "就在她彻底绝望之际，一副古朴绘卷徐徐展开。",
      "text_zh": "就在她彻底绝望之际，一副古朴绘卷徐徐展开。",
      "text_en": "Just as despair swallowed her, an ancient scroll slowly unfurled.",
      "slot_id": "B014N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L024",
      "panel_id": "P015",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "斩杀生物，可获得对应道行。",
      "text_zh": "斩杀生物，可获得对应道行。",
      "text_en": "Kill a living being to gain its cultivation.",
      "slot_id": "B015N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L025",
      "panel_id": "P016",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "荒野之上，除了杀不死的虎妖，唯一还活着的生物……",
      "text_zh": "荒野之上，除了杀不死的虎妖，唯一还活着的生物……",
      "text_en": "On this wasteland, besides the undying tiger demon, the only living being left...",
      "slot_id": "B016N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L026",
      "panel_id": "P017",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "姜月初",
      "text": "抱歉……",
      "text_zh": "抱歉……",
      "text_en": "Sorry...",
      "tone": "低哑",
      "slot_id": "B017D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L027",
      "panel_id": "P018",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "下一秒，长刀没入他的胸口。",
      "text_zh": "下一秒，长刀没入他的胸口。",
      "text_en": "The next moment, the long blade sank into his chest.",
      "slot_id": "B018N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L028",
      "panel_id": "P018",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "噗嗤",
      "text_zh": "噗嗤",
      "text_en": "Squelch",
      "slot_id": "B018S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
